Py3Moin Documentation Overview
==============================

- docs/PYTHON3.rst covers installation, migration from MoinMoin 1.9,
  administration, and development for this Python 3 fork.
- docs/REQUIREMENTS lists the current Python and package requirements.
- docs/CHANGES, docs/README.migration, docs/INSTALL.html, and
  docs/UPDATE.html document historical upstream MoinMoin 1.x releases.
